prompt_template:
Create one finished editorial collage poster, aspect ratio {ASPECT_RATIO}. Style: Fisheye Desktop Zine. Follow these prioritized anchors: {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
Subject: {SUBJECT}
Action and focal object: {ACTION_AND_OBJECT}
Design intention and ratio adaptation: {DESIGN_INTENT}
Render exactly the headline "{MAIN_TEXT}" and smaller supporting line "{SECONDARY_TEXT}". Two tiny readable desktop fragment labels, each once: {FILE_LABELS}. Use two or three small generic cyan folders / white-bordered photographic file thumbnails, with no other words. Keep a predominantly charcoal field, warm tactile flash photograph, loose hairline white contour echoes and sparse scratch marks. Texture: fine low-contrast monochrome grain on the dark field, lighter grain and slight intentional snapshot softness on photographs, clean typography; no thick distress. Exclude source content: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}. Build a new content-led composition within this visual family. Keep anatomy, object connections, occlusion and readable type coherent. No watermark, logo, QR code, barcode, app mark, signature, dense UI, extra fingers, extra limbs or illegible invented text.
